#ASSERT `the gift is permitted` `a full LPA` 0.01 0.05
#ASSERT NOT `the gift is permitted` `a full LPA` 0.2 0.05
#ASSERT NOT `the gift is permitted` `a basic LPA` 0.01 0.05

§ `s 15`

#ASSERT `the donee's appointment ends` `the donee dies` "property and affairs" FALSE
#ASSERT `the donee's appointment ends` `the donee becomes bankrupt` "property and affairs" FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the donee's appointment ends` `the donee becomes bankrupt` "personal welfare" FALSE
#ASSERT `the donee's appointment ends` `the donee divorces P` "personal welfare" FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the donee's appointment ends` `the donee divorces P` "personal welfare" TRUE

#ASSERT `the whole power is revoked` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the whole power is revoked` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the whole power is revoked` TRUE FALSE TRUE

